id: _web_shared
name: Web library
version: 1.0.0
description: 'A web-session daemon for a generator whose run is a browser: daemon.run_web_session serves the
  control socket the client''s own native guest view connects to (the client is the browser; the daemon
  launches none), protocol holds the renderer-facing wire shapes and the tab-<n>.webview file, and capture
  is the handle a capture callback gets. Import it as _web_shared (from _web_shared import run_web_session).'
